elfconv -- https://github.com/yomaytk/elfconv
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

raptormark drives elfconv's `elflift` to lift aarch64 ELF into LLVM IR. The
upstream project is pinned as a submodule at `third_party/elfconv`, and
raptormark's fork of it lives as an ordered patch series under `patches/`,
applied when the builder image is built. Code derived from elfconv is present
in every WebAssembly module raptormark emits.

elfconv in turn incorporates:

  Remill -- https://github.com/lifting-bits/remill
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Vendored and modified by elfconv under `backend/remill`. Remill's runtime
  intrinsics are linked into the emitted module.

  MyAOT -- https://github.com/AkihiroSuda/myaot
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  elfconv began as its successor project.


